EXCEPTION is a event which disturbs the flow of code we have to handle it so that our code will not stop.

TYPES OF EXCEPTION :

• ZERODIVISION ERROR 
• VALUE ERROR 
• TYPE ERROR 
• INDEX ERROR 
• KEY ERROR
• FILENOTFOUND ERROR / IO ERROR 
• INDENTATION ERROR 
• RUNTIME ERROR 
• LOGICAL ERROR
• SYNTAX ERROR 
• EOF ERROR [ END-OF-FILE ]
